. He was disclosed D244,720.00 and D204,400.00 respectively which he disagreed on a letter dated 23/8/2023 and proposed D700,000.00  and D800,000.00 for each as fair compensation.', 'Y', '2023-10-03', 'Y', 'In Person', 'Y', 'Not applicable', 'Closed.', '2025-04-29 16:50:29.3686410 ', 20009, 21, 'D309& D6530 -GM', 'GERMP T&D'), ('GR-TL176', 'M', '2023-10-02', 'Nuha Colley', 'In Person', 'Abubacarr Fanneh', '7373580/7674740', 'He verbally demanded D1.5 million as a fair compensation during the field visit', 'Y', '2023-10-04', 'Y', 'In Person', 'Y', 'Not applicable', 'Closed.', '2025-04-29 16:54:19.8981670 ', 20009, 21, 'D309& D6530 -GM', 'GERMP T&D');